      "Bash(git switch:*)",
      "Bash(git checkout -b:*)",
      "Bash(gh repo view:*)",
      "Bash(gh run watch:*)",
      "Bash(gh pr status:*)",
      {{/* gh's read verbs that ghread covers left this list on 2026-10-22: pr view/list/diff/
           checks, issue view/list, run list/view, search and api. A prefix rule
           on raw gh approves every flag after the verb, so `Bash(gh api:*)` granted any call
           and left the ask rules below to catch -X/-f, which miss spellings such as
