      "Bash(gh workflow list:*)",
      "Bash(gh workflow view:*)",
      "Bash(gh release list:*)",
      "Bash(gh release view:*)",
      {{/* Read verbs added 2026-08-24. The justification first written here was wrong and is
           corrected: it claimed these became load-bearing because gh had moved out of the
