           `gh search` was the largest gap and was added here; it moved to `ghread search` on
           2026-10-22. `gh secret list` is deliberately NOT here — it returns only metadata, but it is a
           credential surface and belongs behind a prompt. */}}
      "Bash(gh repo list:*)",
      "Bash(gh gist view:*)",
      "Bash(gh gist list:*)",
      "Bash(gh label list:*)",
      "Bash(gh cache list:*)",
      "Bash(gh run download:*)",
